    "detailed_description": "Embark on a spine-tingling journey like no other, as you find yourself on a mysterious island after weeks of being lost at sea. Exhausted and delirious, you stumble upon gruesome remains and artifacts that hint at the island's disturbing history. What is the connection between a prize horse, the Salem witch trials, and the rich CEO of a giant corporation?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStep inside the realistic and atmospheric world of Wardwell House, a unique experience created with 3D photographs.  You will be on the edge of your seat as you explore the forest, search for clues, and uncover the chilling secrets that lurk within the walls of Wardwell House. With every step you take, the fear will slowly build up until it becomes almost unbearable.",
